wisp (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release: reproducible initramfs builder and pure-Go /init.
    Coldplug without udev, LUKS2 without cryptsetup, linear LVM without
    lvm2, key sources none/passphrase/credential and external key providers.

